WEBVTT

00:05:28.763 --> 00:05:34.597
"A need to tell and hear stories
is essential to the species Homo Sapiens.

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:39.097
The sound of story
is the dominant sound of our lives."

00:05:39.463 --> 00:05:40.663
- Joseph Campbell

00:05:41.797 --> 00:05:44.897
I've loved telling stories all of my life.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:47.830
I've loved writing them and drawing them,

00:05:47.863 --> 00:05:50.697
and I love teaching my students
how to make them.

00:05:51.663 --> 00:05:55.597
Now I conduct visual storytelling
workshops all over the world.

00:05:56.263 --> 00:05:59.563
Over the years, the students
have invented many new ways

00:05:59.597 --> 00:06:01.697
of expressing their stories.